      "title": "Zelenskyy says ‘increasingly clear’ Russia does not want energy ceasefire after strikes on energy facilities – as it happened",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/oct/12/ukraine-russia-trump-energy-ceasefire-nato-zelenskyy-nobel-latest-news-updates",
      "description": "<p>Zelenskyy had proposed a 60-day total ceasefire to allow Ukraine to hold presidential elections</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/11/zelenskyy-trump-ukraine-russia-energy-ceasefire\">Trump announces partial ceasefire in Ukraine war as Zelenskyy says deal is ‘news to me’</a></p></li></ul><p>Addressing the conference virtually, Ukrainian president Volodymyr Zelenskyy commented on Trump’s “sudden but very important” energy ceasefire declaration over the weekend.</p><p>He said it is clear that Putin “does not read Truth social”, the site that the US president posted his ceasefire declaration on.</p><p><em>Russia wants to ruin the existing security architecture in Europe to make sure that Russian domination comes back to where it was before 1989. We have no doubt about it.</em></p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/oct/12/ukraine-russia-trump-energy-ceasefire-nato-zelenskyy-nobel-latest-news-updates\">Continue reading...</a>",
